# Build context for the metroserve image (Dockerfile at the repo root).
# Allowlist: the Go build needs only the module files, cmd/, internal/ and
# data/. Everything else (temp/, .claude/ worktrees, node_modules/, .git/,
# webconsole/, docs/) stays on the laptop - the pix route ships the context
# over SSH, so an unfiltered context would send gigabytes.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!data/
